# Phase 2.2 — Canon Registry and Intent Resolver (Execution)

Execution secondary for CanonRegistry lifecycle (`proposed → accepted → hooked → sim-active`), IntentResolver routing, LoreHookRegistry projection, and ConflictArbiter surface. Parallel spine under `Roadmap/Execution/Phase-2-…/Phase-2-2-…/`. **No Half B code. No L5 / factory.**

